    "body": "HTML has\r\n\r\n> The IDL fragments in this specification must be interpreted as required for conforming IDL fragments, as described in Web IDL. [WEBIDL]\r\n\r\nI thought it was standard practice to include something along the lines of \"you also need to follow the requirements in this spec's normative dependencies\", but I don't immediately find specs that have it. I wonder if we can make bikeshed add something like that.",
